    \ D\", toss_winner: \"Team D\", winner: null, target_runs: 180, target_overs:\
    \ 20}\n    expected: \"Fails: satisfies('team1 <> team2') [no_self_play]\"\n\n\
    \  - name: \"Toss winner must be one of the teams\"\n    input:\n      rows:\n\
    \        - {id: 1004, season: 2022, date: \"2022-04-15\", result: \"runs\", result_margin:\
    \ 25, toss_decision: \"bat\", super_over: \"N\", match_type: \"League\", method:\
